<title>USA: Nordstrom board OKS share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Nordstrom board OKS share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nordstrom Inc said its board authorized a $100 million share repurchase program.</p>
<p>The program was authorized by the board of directors at its meeting on November 19, 1996.</p>
<p>This repurchase program follows the completion of a similar program authorized by the board in 1995.</p>
</text>
